## 🧠 Additional Notes & Best Practices
- Ennsure that your Salesforce Connected App has the correct OAuth scopes enabled (e.g., <small>`api`, `refresh_token`, `cdp_query`)</small>.
- Keep your credentials stored securely (avoid hardcoding in production scripts).
- Use environment variables or .env files for secure configuration.
- Monitor API rate limits to prevent throttling during large queries.
- You can modify the query variable with custom SQL syntax supported by Salesforce Data Cloud.

